 2007) and its revival "" (2016) as the matriarch of the eponymous Gilmore family.","title":"Emily Gilmore"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Portrayed by actress Kelly Bishop, the character was created by series creator Amy Sherman-Palladino in order to add a more tragic element to the show's comedic nature.","title":"Emily Gilmore"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Emily has had a complicated relationship with her daughter Lorelai ever since the character runs away from home upon giving birth to her daughter Rory at age 16.","title":"Emily Gilmore"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" They remain estranged for several years until Lorelai asks her parents to help pay for Rory's schooling, to which Emily agrees on the condition that her daughter and granddaughter visit her and her husband Richard for dinner every Friday evening.","title":"Emily Gilmore"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Season 5
